          "name": "agenthold_register",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:8ed744d291037fe7ff954981236021e4dfe065f6b9edda14d4613186828a4740",
          "description": "Register yourself and receive a unique agent_id. IMPORTANT: You MUST call this once before using any other agenthold tool that requires an agent_id. Pass your name (e.g. 'editor-agent') and optionally the model you are running on (e.g. 'claude-sonnet-4-6'). The returned agent_id is your identity for this session — use it in all subsequent agenthold_claim and agenthold_release calls. Do not call this more than once per session. If the response status is 'unavailable', the database was briefly locked — retry after a short delay.",
